---
Usage: lentor sandbox setup [OPTIONS] <--user <USER>|--current-user>

Options:
      --elevated           Set up the elevated Windows sandbox
      --user <USER>        Windows user that will run Lentor after managed deployment
      --current-user       Use the current Windows user as the Lentor user
      --lentor-home <DIR>  LENTOR_HOME for the Lentor user. Required with --user
  -h, --help               Print help
